const markdown = "# APOTECH FRONTEND — Tasklist\n\n## Tech Stack Overview\n\n### Dashboard (Web Management)\n- **Framework:** Vue 3 (Composition API + `<script setup>`)\n- **Build Tool:** Vite\n- **State Management:** Pinia\n- **Router:** Vue Router 4\n- **UI Library:** PrimeVue 3\n- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3\n- **Language:** TypeScript\n- **Validation:** Zod\n- **HTTP Client:** Native fetch (custom wrapper)\n\n### POS (Point of Sale — PWA)\n- **Framework:** Vue 3 (Composition API + `<script setup>`)\n- **Build Tool:** Vite\n- **State Management:** Pinia\n- **Router:** Vue Router 4\n- **UI Library:** Custom Components (no external UI library)\n- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3 (mobile-first)\n- **Language:** TypeScript\n- **Validation:** Zod\n- **HTTP Client:** Native fetch (custom wrapper)\n- **Offline Storage:** IndexedDB (Dexie.js)\n- **Service Worker:** Vite PWA plugin\n- **Barcode Scanner:** html5-qrcode (web) → Capacitor plugin (native later)\n\n### Shared Packages\n- **Monorepo:** pnpm workspaces\n- **Build Orchestration:** Turborepo (optional)\n- **Linting:** ESLint + Prettier\n- **Type Checking:** TypeScript (strict mode)\n\n---\n\n# PART 1: DASHBOARD\n\n## **PHASE 1: Monorepo Scaffolding**\n\n### 1.1 Setup Workspace\n- [x] Init pnpm workspace (`pnpm-workspace.yaml`)\n- [x] Create `apps/dashboard/` directory\n- [x] Create `apps/pos/` directory\n- [x] Create `packages/shared/` directory\n- [x] Create `packages/config/` directory\n- [x] Root `package.json` dengan workspace scripts\n\n### 1.2 Shared Packages Setup\n- [x] `packages/shared/types/` — TypeScript interfaces\n  - [x] `product.ts` — Product, ProductBatch types\n  - [x] `sale.ts` — Sale, SaleItem types\n  - [x] `stock.ts` — StockMovement, StockAdjustment types\n  - [x] `supplier.ts` — Supplier types\n  - [x] `user.ts` — User, UserRole types\n  - [x] `store.ts` — Store types\n  - [x] `sync.ts` — SyncEvent, SyncStatus types\n  - [x] `index.ts` — Re-exports\n- [x] `packages/shared/utils/` — Utility functions\n  - [x] `currency.ts` — formatRupiah, parseRupiah\n  - [x] `date.ts` — formatDate, formatDateTime, relativeTime\n  - [x] `validation.ts` — Zod schemas\n  - [x] `stock.ts` — calculateOpeningBalance, etc\n  - [x] `index.ts` — Re-exports\n- [x] `packages/shared/package.json`\n\n### 1.3 Config Packages\n- [x] `packages/config/tailwind/base.js` — Shared Tailwind config\n- [x] `packages/config/eslint/base.js` — ESLint config\n- [x] `packages/config/eslint/vue.js` — ESLint config for Vue\n- [x] `packages/config/tsconfig/base.json` — Base TSConfig\n- [x] `packages/config/tsconfig/vue.json` — Vue TSConfig\n- [x] `packages/config/package.json`\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 2: Dashboard App Setup**\n\n### 2.1 Vue + Vite Scaffolding\n- [x] `pnpm create vue@latest apps/dashboard` (TypeScript + Vue Router + Pinia)\n- [x] Install PrimeVue + PrimeIcons\n- [x] Install Tailwind CSS + PostCSS + Autoprefixer\n- [x] Skip Axios — use native fetch\n- [x] Install Zod (in @apotech/shared)\n- [x] Configure `tailwind.config.js` (extend from shared config)\n- [x] Configure `vite.config.ts` (alias `@` → `src/`)\n- [x] Configure `tsconfig.json` (strict mode, path aliases)\n- [x] Build succeeds (`pnpm --filter dashboard build` ✅)\n\n### 2.2 Base Layout Structure\n- [x] `layouts/DashboardLayout.vue` — Sidebar + Topbar + Main content\n- [ ] `layouts/AuthLayout.vue` — Centered card layout (login)\n- [x] Update `App.vue` dengan `<router-view>` + layout switching\n- [ ] Setup PrimeVue theme (Aura Light Teal)\n\n### 2.3 Router Setup\n- [x] `router/index.ts` — Define routes\n  - [x] `/login` → LoginView\n  - [x] `/` → DashboardView (protected)\n  - [x] `/products` → ProductsView (protected)\n  - [x] `/stock` → StockView (protected)\n  - [x] `/sales` → SalesView (protected)\n  - [x] `/suppliers` → SuppliersView (protected)\n  - [x] `/users` → UsersView (protected)\n  - [x] `/settings` → SettingsView (protected)\n  - [ ] `/reports` → ReportsView (protected) **[not in router yet]**\n  - [ ] `/stock-in` → StockInView (protected) **[not in router yet]**\n  - [ ] `/import` → ImportView (protected) **[not in router yet]**\n  - [ ] `/sync` → SyncView (protected) **[not in router yet]**\n- [x] Navigation guards (auth check)\n- [ ] Active route highlighting di sidebar\n\n### 2.4 Pinia Stores\n- [x] `stores/auth.ts` — User session, login/logout\n- [ ] `stores/store.ts` — Active store context\n- [ ] `stores/products.ts` — Product list + CRUD\n- [ ] `stores/sales.ts` — Sales list + detail\n- [ ] `stores/reports.ts` — Report filters + data\n- [ ] `stores/stock.ts` — Stock movements + card\n- [ ] `stores/suppliers.ts` — Supplier list + CRUD\n- [ ] `stores/users.ts` — User list + CRUD\n- [ ] `stores/notifications.ts` — Toast messages\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 3: Dashboard Reusable UI Components**\n\n### 3.1 Layout Components\n<!-- NOTE: Sidebar + Topbar implemented inline in `layouts/DashboardLayout.vue`, not as separate files. components/layout/ is currently empty. -->\n- [x] `components/layout/Sidebar.vue` — Collapsible sidebar (desktop + mobile) **[inline in DashboardLayout.vue]**\n- [x] `components/layout/Topbar.vue` — Header + breadcrumbs + user menu **[inline in DashboardLayout.vue]**\n- [ ] `components/layout/Breadcrumbs.vue` — Auto-generated dari route\n- [ ] `components/layout/PageHeader.vue` — Title + actions slot\n\n### 3.2 Data Display\n- [ ] `components/ui/KpiCard.vue` — KPI card (icon, label, value, change)\n- [ ] `components/ui/DataTable.vue` — PrimeVue DataTable wrapper\n- [ ] `components/ui/Badge.vue` — Status badges (success, warn, danger, info, muted)\n- [ ] `components/ui/EmptyState.vue` — Empty table/list placeholder\n- [ ] `components/ui/StatCard.vue` — Mini stat card (reports)\n\n### 3.3 Forms & Inputs\n- [ ] `components/ui/FormField.vue` — Label + input + error wrapper\n- [ ] `components/ui/SelectInput.vue` — Dropdown with search\n- [ ] `components/ui/DateRangePicker.vue` — From/To date picker\n- [ ] `components/ui/SearchInput.vue` — Debounced search input\n- [ ] `components/ui/FileUpload.vue` — Drag & drop file upload\n\n### 3.4 Feedback & Overlays\n- [ ] `components/ui/Modal.vue` — PrimeVue Dialog wrapper\n- [ ] `components/ui/ConfirmDialog.vue` — Delete/confirm dialog\n- [ ] `components/ui/Toast.vue` — Success/error notifications\n- [ ] `components/ui/LoadingSpinner.vue` — Spinner + loading state\n- [ ] `components/ui/SkeletonLoader.vue` — Skeleton loading\n\n### 3.5 Charts\n- [ ] `components/ui/BarChart.vue` — Vertical bar chart (sales)\n- [ ] `components/ui/DonutChart.vue` — Donut chart (payment methods)\n- [ ] `components/ui/Sparkline.vue` — Mini trend line (KPI cards)\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 4: Dashboard Feature Slicing (Per Page)**\n\n<!-- STATUS NOTE: Most view files exist as stubs (10 lines, \"coming soon\").\n     Actual file names differ slightly from tasklist:\n     - ProductsView → ProductListView.vue\n     - SalesView → SalesHistoryView.vue\n     - StockView → StockManagementView.vue\n     - SuppliersView → SupplierListView.vue\n     - UsersView → UserManagementView.vue\n     Only LoginView and DashboardView are functional. All others are placeholder stubs. -->\n\n### 4.1 Login Page\n- [x] `views/LoginView.vue`\n  - [x] Email + password form\n  - [x] Form validation (Zod)\n  - [x] Submit → call auth API\n  - [x] Error handling (invalid credentials)\n  - [x] Redirect to `/` on success\n- [ ] Slice login section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 90-140)\n\n### 4.2 Dashboard Page\n- [x] `views/DashboardView.vue`\n  - [x] 4 KPI cards (revenue, transactions, low stock, expired)\n  - [ ] Sales chart (last 7 days)\n  - [ ] Payment method donut chart\n  - [ ] Top products table\n  - [ ] Near-expiry table\n- [ ] `components/dashboard/SalesChart.vue`\n- [ ] `components/dashboard/PaymentDonut.vue`\n- [ ] `components/dashboard/TopProductsTable.vue`\n- [ ] `components/dashboard/NearExpiryTable.vue`\n- [ ] Slice dashboard section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 243-467)\n\n### 4.3 Products Page\n- [ ] `views/products/ProductListView.vue`\n  - [ ] Product table (DataTable)\n  - [ ] Search + filter (category, active status)\n  - [ ] Add/Edit product button\n  - [ ] Delete product (confirm dialog)\n- [ ] `components/products/ProductTable.vue`\n- [ ] `components/products/ProductFormModal.vue`\n  - [ ] Form fields (SKU, name, category, price, dll)\n  - [ ] Validation (Zod)\n  - [ ] Submit → create/update product\n- [ ] Slice products section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 467-553)\n\n### 4.4 Sales Page\n- [ ] `views/sales/SalesHistoryView.vue`\n  - [ ] Sales table (date, cashier, total, payment method)\n  - [ ] Date range filter\n  - [ ] View detail button\n- [ ] `components/sales/SalesTable.vue`\n- [ ] `components/sales/TransactionDetailModal.vue`\n  - [ ] Sale items list\n  - [ ] Payment breakdown\n  - [ ] Receipt preview\n- [ ] Slice sales section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 553-599)\n\n### 4.5 Reports Page\n- [ ] `views/ReportsView.vue`\n  - [ ] Date range filter\n  - [ ] Store filter (multi-store)\n  - [ ] Sales summary cards (revenue, transactions, avg basket)\n  - [ ] Top products table\n  - [ ] Payment method breakdown\n  - [ ] Export button (CSV/Excel)\n- [ ] `components/reports/ReportFilters.vue`\n- [ ] `components/reports/ReportSummaryCards.vue`\n- [ ] `components/reports/TopProductsTable.vue`\n- [ ] `components/reports/PaymentBreakdown.vue`\n- [ ] Slice reports section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 599-697)\n\n### 4.6 Stock In Page (Barang Masuk)\n- [ ] `views/StockInView.vue`\n  - [ ] Stock receipts table (tanggal, supplier, total items)\n  - [ ] Add receipt button\n  - [ ] View detail\n- [ ] `components/stock/StockReceiptTable.vue`\n- [ ] `components/stock/StockReceiptFormModal.vue`\n  - [ ] Select supplier\n  - [ ] Add items (product, batch, qty, expiry)\n  - [ ] Submit → create receipt\n- [ ] Slice stock-in section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 697-751)\n\n### 4.7 Stock Management Page\n- [ ] `views/stock/StockManagementView.vue`\n  - [ ] Stock movements table (tanggal, tipe, qty, keterang