atusCard.vue`\n- [ ] `components/sync/SyncQueueTable.vue`\n- [ ] Slice sync section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 1041-1099)\n\n### 4.12 Settings Page\n- [ ] `views/settings/SettingsView.vue`\n  - [ ] Store profile (name, address, phone)\n  - [ ] Receipt settings (logo, footer text)\n  - [ ] Save changes\n- [ ] `components/settings/StoreProfileForm.vue`\n- [ ] `components/settings/ReceiptSettingsForm.vue`\n- [ ] Slice settings section dari `dashboard.html` (lines 1099-1206)\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 5: Dashboard API Integration**\n\n### 5.1 API Client Setup\n- [x] `packages/shared/api-client/client.ts` — Fetch wrapper + interceptors\n  - [x] Auth header injection\n  - [x] Store ID header\n  - [x] Error handling (401, 403, 500)\n  - [x] Response parsing\n- [x] `packages/shared/api-client/auth.ts` — login, register, me, logout\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/products.ts` — CRUD products\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/sales.ts` — list sales, get detail\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/stock.ts` — movements, card, adjustment, receipt\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/suppliers.ts` — CRUD suppliers\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/users.ts` — CRUD users\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/reports.ts` — sales summary, top products, payment breakdown\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/stores.ts` — CRUD stores\n- [ ] `packages/shared/api-client/sync.ts` — push/pull sync events\n- [x] `packages/shared/api-client/index.ts` — Re-exports\n\n### 5.2 Composables (Data Fetching)\n- [ ] `composables/useAuth.ts` — Login/logout logic\n- [ ] `composables/useProducts.ts` — Fetch + CRUD products\n- [ ] `composables/useSales.ts` — Fetch sales + detail\n- [ ] `composables/useStock.ts` — Fetch movements + card + adjustment\n- [ ] `composables/useSuppliers.ts` — Fetch + CRUD suppliers\n- [ ] `composables/useUsers.ts` — Fetch + CRUD users\n- [ ] `composables/useReports.ts` — Fetch report data\n- [ ] `composables/useImport.ts` — Import Excel flow\n- [ ] `composables/useExport.ts` — Export CSV/Excel\n\n### 5.3 Replace Mock Data\n- [ ] Dashboard KPI cards → API call\n- [ ] Sales chart → API call\n- [ ] Product table → API call (pagination)\n- [ ] Stock movements → API call (filters)\n- [ ] Reports → API call (date range)\n- [ ] Suppliers → API call\n- [ ] Users → API call\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 6: Dashboard Polish & Edge Cases**\n\n### 6.1 Loading States\n- [ ] Skeleton loaders di semua tables\n- [ ] Loading spinners di forms (submit)\n- [ ] Button disabled states (loading)\n- [ ] Chart loading states\n\n### 6.2 Empty States\n- [ ] Empty product table → \"Belum ada produk\"\n- [ ] Empty sales table → \"Belum ada transaksi\"\n- [ ] Empty stock movements → \"Belum ada pergerakan stock\"\n- [ ] Empty search results → \"Tidak ditemukan\"\n\n### 6.3 Error Handling\n- [ ] API error → Toast notification\n- [ ] Form validation errors → Inline error messages\n- [ ] Network error → Retry button\n- [ ] 401 Unauthorized → Redirect to login\n- [ ] 403 Forbidden → \"Akses ditolak\" message\n\n### 6.4 Success States\n- [ ] Create product → Toast \"Produk berhasil ditambahkan\"\n- [ ] Update product → Toast \"Produk berhasil diupdate\"\n- [ ] Delete product → Toast \"Produk berhasil dihapus\"\n- [ ] (Repeat untuk semua CRUD operations)\n\n### 6.5 Responsive Design\n- [x] Mobile sidebar (hamburger menu + overlay)\n- [ ] Responsive tables (horizontal scroll di mobile)\n- [ ] Responsive modals (full-screen di mobile)\n- [ ] Responsive KPI cards (stack di mobile)\n- [ ] Test di 320px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px\n\n### 6.6 Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)\n- [ ] Semantic HTML (`<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`)\n- [ ] ARIA labels di semua interactive elements\n- [ ] Keyboard navigation (Tab, Enter, Escape)\n- [ ] Focus indicators\n- [ ] Color contrast (minimum 4.5:1)\n- [ ] Screen reader testing\n\n### 6.7 Performance\n- [ ] Lazy load routes (dynamic imports)\n- [ ] Debounce search inputs (300ms)\n- [ ] Paginate tables (default 10 rows)\n- [ ] Virtual scroll buat large tables (>100 rows)\n- [ ] Optimize images (WebP, lazy load)\n\n---\n\n## **PHASE 7: Dashboard Testing & Deployment**\n\n### 7.1 Unit Tests (Vitest)\n- [ ] Utils tests (currency, date, validation)\n- [ ] Composables tests (mock API)\n- [ ] Component tests (render, interaction)\n\n### 7.2 E2E Tests (Playwright)\n- [ ] Login flow\n- [ ] Create product flow\n- [ ] View reports flow\n- [ ] Stock adjustment flow\n\n### 7.3 Build & Deploy\n- [ ] Production build (`pnpm build`)\n- [ ] Deploy ke Vercel/Netlify\n- [ ] Environment variables setup\n- [ ] Custom domain (optional)\n\n---\n\n# PART 2: POS (Point of Sale — PWA)\n\n## **PHASE 8: POS App Setup**\n\n### 8.1 Vue + Vite Scaffolding\n- [x] `pnpm create vue@latest apps/pos` (TypeScript + Vue Router + Pinia)\n- [x] Install Tailwind CSS + PostCSS + Autoprefixer\n- [x] Install Dexie.js (IndexedDB wrapper)\n- [x] Install `vite-plugin-pwa` (service worker + manifest)\n- [x] Install Zod (in @apotech/shared)\n- [x] Configure `tailwind.config.js` (mobile-first, extend from shared)\n- [x] Configure `vite.config.ts` (alias `@` → `src/`, PWA plugin)\n- [x] Configure `tsconfig.json` (strict mode, path aliases)\n- [x] Build succeeds (`pnpm --filter pos build` ✅, PWA SW generated)\n\n### 8.2 Base Layout Structure\n<!-- NOTE: layouts/ folder is empty. No POSLayout.vue file exists yet. Views render without layout wrapper. -->\n- [ ] `layouts/POSLayout.vue` — Full-screen layout (no sidebar) **[file does not exist yet]**\n- [ ] `layouts/AuthLayout.vue` — Centered card layout (login)\n- [x] Update `App.vue` dengan `<router-view>` + layout switching\n- [x] Setup custom theme (Tailwind config)\n\n### 8.3 Router Setup\n- [x] `router/index.ts` — Define routes\n  - [x] `/login` → LoginView\n  - [x] `/` → redirect `/pos`\n  - [x] `/pos` → POSView (protected, main POS screen)\n  - [x] `/cart` → CartView (protected)\n  - [x] `/payment` → PaymentView (protected)\n  - [x] `/receipt/:id` → ReceiptView (protected)\n  - [x] `/history` → HistoryView (protected, own sale